{"created": "2022-10-16T16:27:40.498680+00:00", "modified": "2022-10-17T12:14:46.580884+00:00", "id": 7213408, "conceptrecid": "7213407", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.7213408", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.7213407", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7213408", "metadata": {"title": "Datacubes of InSAR time series for active volcanoes", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.7213408", "publication_date": "2022-10-16", "description": "<p>Datacubes of InSAR time series for the 20 volcanoes (*) flagged in the paper &quot;Large-scale demonstration of machine learning for the detection of volcanic deformation in Sentinel-1 satellite imagery&quot; by Biggs et al. (Bull Volc, 2022).</p>\n\n<p>Each file contains the time series of cumulative displacements for one volcano in the *.nc format. There are four fields with &quot;DATA&quot; : cumulative LOS displacements (unit=meters), &quot;lon&quot; : longitude (unit=degrees), &quot;lat&quot; : latitude (unit=degrees) and &quot;time&quot; : number of days since the first date.&nbsp;The first date can be found in the attribute &quot;units&quot; of the variable &quot;time&quot;.</p>\n\n<p>(*) The five volcanoes: Sierra Negra, Fernandina, Cerro Azul, Wolf and Alcedo volcanoes are contained in the single file&nbsp;&quot;galapagos_128D_09016_110500.nc&quot;.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Fabien Albino", "affiliation": "ISTerre, Universite de Grenoble-Alpes", "orcid": "0000-0001-9279-8125"}], "keywords": ["InSAR ground deformation volcanoes"], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "7213407"}}]}}, "title": "Datacubes of InSAR time series for active volcanoes", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7213408", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7213408", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7213408?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7213408", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7213408", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.7213408", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7213408/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7213407", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7213407", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7213407", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.7213407", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:7213408/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:7213408/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7213408/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7213408/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7213408/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7213408/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7213408/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7213408/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7213408/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7213408/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7213408/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7213408/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7213408/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7213408/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7213408/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7213408/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7213408/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7213408/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7213408/requests"}, "updated": "2022-10-17T12:14:46.580884+00:00", "recid": "7213408", "revision": 4, "files": [{"id": "d9bc0dbb-8a69-4c4e-896d-2114457a5558", "key": "datacube_volcanoes.zip", "size": 1927665286, "checksum": "md5:bdd67f11501d17c5ed7f